<title>USA: Campbell-Savona CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Campbell-Savona CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc. said it won $3.450 million of Campbell-Savona Central School District, N.Y., school district serial bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.700 percent.</p>
